Source: moobfs
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: MoobFS maintainers <claudio@studiomoob.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-sequence-dkms
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/studiomoob/llmoobfs
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: moobfs-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-amd64
Description: MoobFS layer module as DKMS sources (experimental)
 Sources of moobfs_layer, a stacking Linux filesystem that keeps an index of
 the typed user.moob.* attributes of each directory domain and answers
 queries from it. DKMS builds the module only for the kernel releases the
 project tests (BUILD_EXCLUSIVE_KERNEL) and signs it with the DKMS machine
 owner key when the kernel supports module signing.
 .
 Experimental research software, for disposable test hosts only. Not
 published: built and tested in virtual machines (roadmap item C6).

Package: moobfs-tools
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: moobfs-dkms
Description: MoobFS user-space tools (experimental)
 moobfs (query and inspect a mount), moobfs-attr (typed attributes),
 moobfs-check (consistency check of a lower directory) and moobfs-index
 (user-space index of a domain), with their manual pages.
 .
 Experimental research software, for disposable test hosts only.
